pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 60, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Pinto 2019 — 背景 + 方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 150, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>TrustZone 长期被广泛部署，但公开系统化资料不足</li>
        <li>学术系统和产业 TEE 栈边界不统一</li>
        <li>术语碎片化，缺乏统一的 taxonomy 和分类框架</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: section2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 380, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>按系统软件、TEE、虚拟化和应用场景分类，建立 survey map</li>
        <li>TEE OS and trusted applications 的系统分析</li>
        <li>Hardware-assisted virtualization use cases</li>
        <li>IoT and mobile deployment patterns</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 660, 1100, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>来源：Pinto 2019, DOI: 10.1145/3291047; local PDF 已核验</p>